// App.xcconfig — base build settings for the WantProcuration target (committed).
//
// Phase 0 (Mrasem): the proxy app's AI Gateway signing secret was removed together
// with the gateway code. Mrasem talks to no backend in this phase, so nothing secret
// is needed here.
//
// Rule D5: never commit real secrets. If a future phase needs one, put it in
// Config/Secrets.xcconfig (ignored by git) and pull it in with #include? below.
// Note: in .xcconfig files "//" starts a comment, so a secret must not contain "//".

#include? "Secrets.xcconfig"
